<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Niugini links half loss to gold mines.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Niugini links half loss to gold mines.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Niugini Mining NL said on Wednesday that lower metal production in Australia and higher operating costs in Chile contributed to the company's net loss of US$3.1 million for the half-year to June 30.</p>
<p>At the company's Red Dome Mine in Queensland, operating profit slipped to $2.01 million in the half-year from $3.93 million in the year earlier period, owing to a decline in equivialent gold output to 63,035 ounces from 73,493 over the period, Niugini said.</p>
</text>
